{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d00c8a0baadc49c0","name":"Ruthic","source":{"id":"source:reference-d00c8a0baadc49c0","title":"Ruthic","revision":21428,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:47:02Z","sha256":"38a515154eb500e1d1b721738c4d79e87be1d611cfb0d9bcb1381eb5196703ca","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21428","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ruthic&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d00c8a0baadc49c0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Tulpaa Tribe"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Tulpaa_Tribe","referenceId":"reference:576e78d85749d44f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rakatan Tribes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rakatan_Tribes","referenceId":"reference:a5392db77f9ae3f3"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elder Ruthic is an unusual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakata","referenceId":"reference:0b233b768a3d506b"},"- a priest with the skills of a warrior. She became head of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Tulpaa Tribe"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Tulpaa_Tribe","referenceId":"reference:576e78d85749d44f"}," by exiling the former leaders into the empty eternity of a mind trap. Unique among ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakata","referenceId":"reference:0b233b768a3d506b"},", she has been growing closer to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," with each passing year. This development has given her great insight into the technology of her ancestors, and her tribe now sends hundreds of Skipships to scour ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," for slaves and resources. Meanwhile, the metal skeleton of a new Star Forge is taking shape in the skies above ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tulpaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tulpaa?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Ruthic is very bright and not given to anger or excess. The tribal leader realizes that the generations before her failed to use all the power available to them, and she is determined to uncover every lost secret. Because her emerging Force-sensitivity appears to be a fluke, she has ordered her priests to cut apart healthy slaves to determine if ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," lies in their blood, their organs, or their brains.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elder Ruthic is protected by two Gengh-Noghri wherever she goes. These offshoots of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noghri"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noghri","referenceId":"reference:3b34c955e2b5b5b3"}," Species, brought to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tulpaa"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tulpaa?action=edit&redlink=1"}," from Honoghr's slave stock, are over 2 meters in height and have massive crocodilian heads filled with flesh-tearing teeth.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Lurking in the shadows of her ruling temple is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Raspir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Raspir?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a pure-blooded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith?action=edit&redlink=1"}," released from a mind trap prison when Ruthic banished her opponents to the same device. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Raspir"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Raspir?action=edit&redlink=1"}," once served Sith King ",{"tag":"a","children":["Adas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Adas?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as a court magician. As a practitioner of Dark Sith magic, he has given Ruthic wise advice on how to bend the creation engines of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Star Forge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Star_Forge"}," to her will.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Ruthic Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rakata"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rakata","referenceId":"reference:0b233b768a3d506b"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 1; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 6; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +16\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Minnisiat, Rakata, Rammocate, Sy Bisti, Vagaari\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 18), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href"